        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;What runs where.&lt;/b&gt; The agent — rubric, deterministic candidate layer, browser driving — runs inside the AgentCore runtime. The harness on the GitHub runner holds no rubric: it invokes the runtime, re-validates the findings JSON, prices the run and posts the PR comment. The runtime writes its own reports, so the CI-reachable OIDC role stays at two statements." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;spacing=8;strokeColor=#B0B0B0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="760" width="380" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
